{
  "title": "Build a Blog: Posts, Categories, Tags and a Menu | Orchard Core",
  "description": "A blog is more than a list of posts: readers browse by category and by tag, and they need a menu to find their way around.\n\nThe Blog recipe and The Blog Theme set up a blog in Orchard Core. This video shows how the parts fit together, and how to add a category, write a post with its tags, and add an item to the Main Menu from the admin.\n\nIn this video:\n• How a blog fits together: the Blog, its posts, two taxonomies and a menu\n• A tour of the blog on the site and in the admin\n• Add a category\n• Write a post\n• Tags, the terms created from a post\n• Add a menu item",
